-> T26 Phase 3: matching a union alternative's *shape* isn't enough — the
-> Schema branch's own field constraints still apply. `code` must be
-> ∈ Number; a String there fails the Error branch too, so the whole union
-> is unsatisfied.
Status = { "Success" } ∪ { tag = "Error", code ∈ Number }
s ∈ Status
s = { tag = "Error", code = "not a number" }
